* profiles/ls1u/models/ls1u.lib — generated by scripts/gen_models.py
* source: LibreSilicon process repository simulation/nmos1u.lib and
*         simulation/pmos1u.lib at the profile manifest commit
* normalization: corrected the upstream NMOS .ENDS subcircuit name
* empirical PMOS fit: VTH0=-0.6 V, U0=83 cm^2/V/s
* fit source: supplied thermally_compensated.ods; L10/W10; low confidence
* fit window: corrected Id_residue, VSG=1.5..5 V, VDS=-0.5 V
* caveat: NGATE/PGATE remain unmeasured in the upstream cards
.lib ls1u

.SUBCKT LV1UNMOS D G S B
+ PARAMS:
+ W=15E-7
+ L=10E-7
+ PD=25E-7
+ PS=25E-7

M1 D G S B NMOS W={W} L={L} PD={PD} PS={PS}

.MODEL NMOS NMOS (
+ LEVEL   = 8
+ VERSION = 3.3.1
+ TNOM    = 27
+ U0      = 1160.761537104032
+ TOX     = 40E-9
+ XT      = 2E-6
+ XJ      = 100E-9
+ NCH     = 1.7E17
+ NSUB    = 1.7E17
+ VTH0    = -0.7
+ W0      = 1.280703E-8
+ NLX     = 0
+ Lmin    = 5E-7
+ Lmax    = 15E-7
+ Wmin    = 10E-7
+ Wmax    = 20E-7
+ )

* NGATE has to be measured!

.ENDS LV1UNMOS

.SUBCKT LV1UPMOS D G S B
+ PARAMS:
+ W=30E-7
+ L=10E-7
+ PD=30E-7
+ PS=30E-7

M1 D G S B PMOS W={W} L={L} PD={PD} PS={PS}

.MODEL PMOS PMOS (
+ LEVEL   = 8
+ VERSION = 3.3.1
+ TNOM    = 27
+ U0      = 83.0
+ TOX     = 40E-9
+ XT      = 2E-6
+ XJ      = 100E-9
+ NCH     = 1.7E17
+ NSUB    = 1.7E17
+ VTH0    = -0.6
+ W0      = 1.280703E-8
+ NLX     = 0
+ Lmin    = 5E-7
+ Lmax    = 15E-7
+ Wmin    = 25E-7
+ Wmax    = 35E-7
+ )

* PGATE has to be measured!

.ENDS LV1UPMOS

.endl ls1u
